{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20129",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 4.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.91,
      "end_seconds": 7.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.12,
      "end_seconds": 14.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.59,
      "end_seconds": 18.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Okay, how are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 20.03,
      "end_seconds": 23.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "She's been having heavy periods, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.34,
      "end_seconds": 27.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.61,
      "end_seconds": 40.62,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "It's been about a year now. Oh, and being breathless on the stairs. That's been about the same, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.36,
      "end_seconds": 44.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.85,
      "end_seconds": 59.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.64,
      "text": "I get some relief from resting. As for looking pale, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.79,
      "end_seconds": 80.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Any chest pain or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.38,
      "end_seconds": 85.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "No, no chest pain or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.25,
      "end_seconds": 90.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you had any pelvic pain or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.34,
      "end_seconds": 96.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "No, um, no pelvic pain or fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.04,
      "end_seconds": 102.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.57,
      "end_seconds": 109.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.67,
      "end_seconds": 128.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.9,
      "end_seconds": 133.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 135.31,
      "end_seconds": 142.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "I'm not sure that's right. I seem to recall a problem with diclofenac."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.06,
      "end_seconds": 146.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Let me think, I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.14,
      "end_seconds": 155.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said. Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.25,
      "end_seconds": 169.35,
      "duration_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.42,
      "end_seconds": 174.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 176.77,
      "end_seconds": 180.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "It's escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.85,
      "end_seconds": 184.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How long have you taken that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 188.38,
      "end_seconds": 197.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.63,
      "text": "For about a year. It's allopurinol, 100 milligrams, once a day, doctor. She takes iron tablets, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.99,
      "end_seconds": 201.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.96,
      "end_seconds": 205.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "My mother has an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.01,
      "end_seconds": 209.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.87,
      "end_seconds": 213.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Depression, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.38,
      "end_seconds": 219.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.65,
      "end_seconds": 222.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "I've had gout, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.85,
      "end_seconds": 228.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Alright, depression, that matches what I have here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 229.18,
      "end_seconds": 241.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.52,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 15, BP is 115 over 77. Pulse is 70 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature is 37.0 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.8,
      "end_seconds": 243.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.86,
      "end_seconds": 249.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.41,
      "end_seconds": 254.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.15,
      "end_seconds": 272.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Your eyelids and the palms of your hands look pale."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.67,
      "end_seconds": 278.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.67,
      "end_seconds": 306.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with heavy periods with iron deficiency. It could also be fibroids, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.13,
      "end_seconds": 309.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Well, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.79,
      "end_seconds": 330.24,
      "duration_seconds": 18.45,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like heavy periods with iron deficiency. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had heavy periods for about a year, and no weight loss or fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.71,
      "end_seconds": 333.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.2,
      "end_seconds": 343.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "You'll be taking tranexamic acid, 1 gram, three times a day during periods, for four days each cycle. It's for heavy periods."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.37,
      "end_seconds": 347.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Should I take that with food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.95,
      "end_seconds": 355.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Let's plan a check in six weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.95,
      "end_seconds": 360.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.69,
      "end_seconds": 362.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}